('ee2062a6-c898-58c9-93a0-add435f38db3'::uuid, '2026-06-19'::date, $dq${}$dq$::jsonb, $dq${}$dq$::jsonb, $dq$[]$dq$::jsonb, $dq$[{"bft": 3, "ws": 4, "wg": 6, "wd": 5, "dir": "N", "wv": 0.5, "waveDir": "N", "sst": 12, "tc": 11, "feels": 8, "pres": 1000, "presTrend": "steady", "cond": {"icon": "⛅️", "desc": "Skýjað að hluta", "code": 2}, "flag": "green", "ts": "2026-06-19T08:32", "time": "08:32"}, {"bft": 2, "ws": 3, "wg": 6, "wd": 48, "dir": "NE", "wv": 0.6, "waveDir": "N", "sst": 12.2, "tc": 15, "feels": 12, "pres": 999, "presTrend": "steady", "cond": {"icon": "☁️", "desc": "Overcast", "code": 3}, "flag": "green", "ts": "2026-06-22T10:06", "time": "13:00", "retro": true}, {"bft": 2, "ws": 3, "wg": 6, "wd": 33, "dir": "NNE", "wv": 0.6, "waveDir": "N", "sst": 12.3, "tc": 15, "feels": 12, "pres": 998, "presTrend": "steady", "cond": {"icon": "☁️", "desc": "Overcast", "code": 3}, "flag": "green", "ts": "2026-06-22T10:06", "time": "17:00", "retro": true}]$dq$::jsonb, $dq$No contemporaneous class notes. Lower energy day overall (esp. in afternoon). No Alex/Ágúst in PM. Sailed with Kolbeinn, Sindri till ~20:30, also trying spinnakers.$dq$, $dq${"h1t": "09:42", "h1h": "4.1", "l1t": "03:24", "l1h": "0.0", "h2t": "21:54", "h2h": "3.9", "l2t": "15:48", "l2h": "0.4"}$dq$::jsonb, NULL, NULL, $dq$steve$dq$, '2026-06-19T08:32:49.318Z'::timestamptz, '2026-06-22T10:08:47.871Z'::timestamptz),
('57a21966-324b-5be5-b4f5-d46159aa85fa'::uuid, '2026-06-17'::date, $dq${}$dq$::jsonb, $dq${}$dq$::jsonb, $dq$[]$dq$::jsonb, $dq$[{"bft": 2, "ws": 3, "wg": 7, "wd": 18, "dir": "NNE", "wv": 0.6, "waveDir": "N", "sst": 12.2, "tc": 12, "feels": 9, "pres": 1005, "presTrend": "steady", "cond": {"icon": "☁️", "desc": "Overcast", "code": 3}, "flag": "green", "ts": "2026-06-22T10:01", "time": "12:00", "retro": true}]$dq$::jsonb, $dq$Wingfoiling practice moved to kl. 12. Jón, SDS, Gylfi, Joana. Pawel joined on support boat. 2.5–3.5h of practice. Good wind at end. David, Pawel on Yngling, towed back in no wind. No rowers in PM.$dq$, $dq${"h1t": "08:06", "h1h": "4.4", "l1t": "01:48", "l1h": "-0.3", "h2t": "20:18", "h2h": "4.3", "l2t": "14:12", "l2h": "0.2"}$dq$::jsonb, NULL, NULL, $dq$steve$dq$, '2026-06-22T10:03:22.297Z'::timestamptz, '2026-06-22T10:03:36.640Z'::timestamptz),
('b1a9948e-55e7-5963-96d6-be51d952ae10'::uuid, '2026-06-20'::date, $dq${}$dq$::jsonb, $dq${}$dq$::jsonb, $dq$[]$dq$::jsonb, $dq$[{"bft": 2, "ws": 2, "wg": 4, "wd": 360, "dir": "N", "wv": 0.6, "waveDir": "N", "sst": 12.1, "tc": 11, "feels": 9, "pres": 1001, "presTrend": "steady", "cond": {"icon": "☁️", "desc": "Overcast", "code": 3}, "flag": "green", "ts": "2026-06-22T10:08", "time": "09:03", "retro": true}, {"bft": 2, "ws": 3, "wg": 5, "wd": 344, "dir": "NNW", "wv": 0.6, "waveDir": "N", "sst": 12.2, "tc": 12, "feels": 9, "pres": 1002, "presTrend": "steady", "cond": {"icon": "☁️", "desc": "Overcast", "code": 3}, "flag": "green", "ts": "2026-06-22T10:09", "time": "11:30", "retro": true}]$dq$::jsonb, $dq$Miðsumarmót at Vogur. Prammi, Steady on site. SDS, Snorri present. Gunnar H, Gunnar S, Alli, Þrúður, Egill, Ásgeir, Elias competing. Much disorganization but overall good day. Open house managed by Hannes, David. Sindri (LAS-OA 1) out on Zest. Helena, others on Quest. Hannes & family on Yngling. Sækisi sailing in the evening.$dq$, $dq${"h1t": "10:30", "h1h": "3.9", "l1t": "04:12", "l1h": "0.3", "h2t": "22:54", "h2h": "3.7", "l2t": "16:42", "l2h": "0.6"}$dq$::jsonb, NULL, NULL, $dq$steve$dq$, '2026-06-22T10:12:06.486Z'::timestamptz, '2026-06-22T10:12:06.486Z'::timestamptz),
('e6fea71b-46b2-59ae-ad8f-ad0286b2e43c'::uuid, '2026-06-21'::date, $dq${}$dq$::jsonb, $dq${}$dq$::jsonb, $dq$[]$dq$::jsonb, $dq$[{"bft": 3, "ws": 3, "wg": 7, "wd": 284, "dir": "WNW", "wv": 0.2, "waveDir": "WNW", "sst": 12.3, "tc": 11, "feels": 9, "pres": 1017, "presTrend": "rising", "cond": {"icon": "🌤", "desc": "Mainly clear", "code": 1}, "flag": "green", "ts": "2026-06-22T10:12", "time": "12:00", "retro": true}]$dq$::jsonb, $dq$SDS at Brokey kl. 9–16+ for keppnisþjálfaranámskeið with Rob Holden. Stebba, Arnhildur with björgunarsveit on doughnut. Alli+ on Quest. Egill, Ásgeir, Kelvin fishing. No one with primary responsibility for house. SDS came by 17–18:30. Kids, Sækisi closed up.$dq$, $dq${"h1t": "11:24", "h1h": "3.7", "l1t": "05:06", "l1h": "0.5", "h2t": "23:54", "h2h": "3.5", "l2t": "17:42", "l2h": "0.7"}$dq$::jsonb, NULL, NULL, $dq$steve$dq$, '2026-06-22T10:14:44.339Z'::timestamptz, '2026-06-22T10:14:44.339Z'::timestamptz),
('e7b9b6e1-20bc-503f-8226-f21a886ee3a2'::uuid, '2026-06-22'::date, $dq${}$dq$::jsonb, $dq${"3c753ab1f13d46db": true, "810899dec1184f54": true, "fa2be00300264aa6": true, "cac93d951f4947ca": true, "105f29eb6c674640": true, "050c6d83e72d4465": true, "b334ee634dc34629": true, "dc97f1fb65a24399": true, "14ae3fd0e7d845f3": true, "42dd29fa887549e8": true, "6bb8c406634f4a31": true, "3e663ec3e5124ef4": true}$dq$::jsonb, $dq$[]$dq$::jsonb, $dq$[{"bft": 2, "ws": 3, "wg": 6, "wd": 220, "dir": "SW", "wv": 0.2, "waveDir": "SW", "sst": 12.3, "tc": 10, "feels": 8, "pres": 1019, "presTrend": "steady", "cond": {"icon": "☁️", "desc": "Overcast", "code": 3}, "flag": "green", "ts": "2026-06-23T09:20", "time": "09:00", "retro": true}, {"bft": 2, "ws": 3, "wg": 6, "wd": 317, "dir": "NW", "wv": 0.2, "waveDir": "SW", "sst": 12.5, "tc": 11, "feels": 9, "pres": 1019, "presTrend": "steady", "cond": {"icon": "🌧️", "desc": "Rain", "code": 80}, "flag": "green", "ts": "2026-06-23T09:20", "time": "13:00", "retro": true}, {"bft": 2, "ws": 3, "wg": 6, "wd": 319, "dir": "NW", "wv": 0.2, "waveDir": "SW", "sst": 12.8, "tc": 11, "feels": 8, "pres": 1017, "presTrend": "steady", "cond": {"icon": "☁️", "desc": "Overcast", "code": 3}, "flag": "green", "ts": "2026-06-23T09:21", "time": "17:00", "retro": true}]$dq$::jsonb, $dq$Solid day overall. No more kjölbátur 1 until August. AMJ, ES helped in AM, sailed in PM. Wingfoil in PM? Rob gave presentation on Skipper Foundation.$dq$, $dq${"h1t": "12:24", "h1h": "3.5", "l1t": "06:06", "l1h": "0.8", "h2t": "", "h2h": "", "l2t": "18:42", "l2h": "0.8"}$dq$::jsonb, NULL, NULL, $dq$steve$dq$, '2026-06-23T09:22:15.497Z'::timestamptz, '2026-06-23T09:44:17.484Z'::timestamptz),
