('97809887-1392-518d-9c87-423b78eeb87a'::uuid, '2026-06-23'::date, $dq${}$dq$::jsonb, $dq${}$dq$::jsonb, $dq$[]$dq$::jsonb, $dq$[{"bft": 2, "ws": 2, "wg": 4, "wd": 58, "dir": "ENE", "wv": 0.2, "waveDir": "SW", "sst": 12.3, "tc": 12, "feels": 10, "pres": 1008, "presTrend": "falling", "cond": {"icon": "☁️", "desc": "Overcast", "code": 3}, "flag": "green", "ts": "2026-06-24T09:07", "time": "09:00", "retro": true}, {"bft": 2, "ws": 2, "wg": 4, "wd": 355, "dir": "N", "wv": 0.2, "waveDir": "SW", "sst": 12.4, "tc": 14, "feels": 12, "pres": 1005, "presTrend": "falling", "cond": {"icon": "☁️", "desc": "Overcast", "code": 3}, "flag": "green", "ts": "2026-06-24T09:08", "time": "13:00", "retro": true}, {"bft": 2, "ws": 2, "wg": 4, "wd": 72, "dir": "ENE", "wv": 0.3, "waveDir": "WSW", "sst": 12.4, "tc": 14, "feels": 12, "pres": 1003, "presTrend": "falling", "cond": {"icon": "🌧️", "desc": "Rain", "code": 61}, "flag": "green", "ts": "2026-06-24T09:08", "time": "17:00", "retro": true}]$dq$::jsonb, $dq$Hæfur Háseti also trained on Carmen, Yngling with Sigga. Overall solid day. GGSport repaired rocket, needs pickup. Have begun always tying off halyards on quests again.$dq$, $dq${"h1t": "01:00", "h1h": "3.4", "l1t": "07:12", "l1h": "1.0", "h2t": "13:30", "h2h": "3.4", "l2t": "19:54", "l2h": "0.9"}$dq$::jsonb, NULL, NULL, $dq$steve$dq$, '2026-06-24T09:03:39.899Z'::timestamptz, '2026-06-24T09:08:18.707Z'::timestamptz),
('e6ea5ac1-6bb6-5888-af56-c99e87480085'::uuid, '2026-06-25'::date, $dq${}$dq$::jsonb, $dq${}$dq$::jsonb, $dq$[]$dq$::jsonb, $dq$[{"bft": 2, "ws": 2, "wg": 5, "wd": 221, "dir": "SW", "wv": 0.5, "waveDir": "SW", "sst": 12.3, "tc": 10, "feels": 8, "pres": 1005, "presTrend": "steady", "cond": {"icon": "🌧️", "desc": "Rain", "code": 61}, "flag": "green", "ts": "2026-06-27T11:20", "time": "09:00", "retro": true}, {"bft": 3, "ws": 4, "wg": 8, "wd": 234, "dir": "SW", "wv": 0.5, "waveDir": "SW", "sst": 12.3, "tc": 10, "feels": 7, "pres": 1005, "presTrend": "steady", "cond": {"icon": "🌧️", "desc": "Rain", "code": 61}, "flag": "green", "ts": "2026-06-27T11:20", "time": "13:00", "retro": true}, {"bft": 3, "ws": 5, "wg": 10, "wd": 227, "dir": "SW", "wv": 0.5, "waveDir": "SW", "sst": 12.3, "tc": 10, "feels": 6, "pres": 1005, "presTrend": "steady", "cond": {"icon": "🌧️", "desc": "Rain", "code": 80}, "flag": "green", "ts": "2026-06-27T11:20", "time": "17:00", "retro": true}]$dq$::jsonb, $dq$Day normative. Rapid wind build ca. kl 17; SW–W up to 30 knots, delayed PM class on shore till after kl 18. After that, typical sail. Club kids out on topper, zest. Anna Karen, Katrín on Yngling. Early day call from Bruno on Lengaï (Les Glénans) -- torn gennaker. Contacted Guðjón Ingi re: repair possibility, getting workshop started$dq$, $dq${"h1t": "03:18", "h1h": "3.3", "l1t": "09:24", "l1h": "1.1", "h2t": "15:30", "h2h": "3.4", "l2t": "21:54", "l2h": "0.8"}$dq$::jsonb, NULL, NULL, $dq$steve$dq$, '2026-06-27T11:25:39.901Z'::timestamptz, '2026-06-27T11:32:00.069Z'::timestamptz),
('0a360167-fa31-59ac-a9ea-8d5cea648496'::uuid, '2026-06-26'::date, $dq${}$dq$::jsonb, $dq${}$dq$::jsonb, $dq$[]$dq$::jsonb, $dq$[{"bft": 3, "ws": 4, "wg": 8, "wd": 243, "dir": "WSW", "wv": 1, "waveDir": "WSW", "sst": 12.1, "tc": 10, "feels": 7, "pres": 1005, "presTrend": "steady", "cond": {"icon": "🌧️", "desc": "Rain", "code": 80}, "flag": "green", "ts": "2026-06-27T11:26", "time": "09:00", "retro": true}, {"bft": 3, "ws": 4, "wg": 9, "wd": 233, "dir": "SW", "wv": 0.9, "waveDir": "WSW", "sst": 12.2, "tc": 11, "feels": 8, "pres": 1006, "presTrend": "steady", "cond": {"icon": "🌧️", "desc": "Rain", "code": 80}, "flag": "green", "ts": "2026-06-27T11:26", "time": "13:00", "retro": true}, {"bft": 3, "ws": 3, "wg": 8, "wd": 208, "dir": "SSW", "wv": 0.8, "waveDir": "WSW", "sst": 12.3, "tc": 12, "feels": 9, "pres": 1006, "presTrend": "falling", "cond": {"icon": "🌧️", "desc": "Rain", "code": 80}, "flag": "green", "ts": "2026-06-27T11:26", "time": "17:00", "retro": true}]$dq$::jsonb, $dq$Day generally nominal, though see incident report. (!) New tear in blue rocket; 100% of use results in tear (definitely not overinflated.) Really positive end to adult class. Guðjón Ingi setting up sail repair.$dq$, $dq${"h1t": "04:12", "h1h": "3.4", "l1t": "10:18", "l1h": "1.1", "h2t": "16:24", "h2h": "3.5", "l2t": "22:42", "l2h": "0.7"}$dq$::jsonb, NULL, NULL, $dq$steve$dq$, '2026-06-27T11:27:36.361Z'::timestamptz, '2026-06-27T11:29:20.341Z'::timestamptz),
('0c2a147a-48ba-56c8-a16a-52fc9a90e5f6'::uuid, '2026-06-27'::date, $dq${}$dq$::jsonb, $dq${}$dq$::jsonb, $dq$[]$dq$::jsonb, $dq$[{"bft": 3, "ws": 5, "wg": 10, "wd": 118, "dir": "ESE", "wv": 0.8, "waveDir": "SSE", "sst": 12.1, "tc": 11, "feels": 8, "pres": 1003, "presTrend": "steady", "cond": {"icon": "🌧️", "desc": "Rain", "code": 61}, "flag": "green", "ts": "2026-06-28T19:42", "time": "10:00", "retro": true}]$dq$::jsonb, $dq$Mast raised on Gróa: boat is ready for test sail. Guðjón Ingi & Guðrún Bryndís set up machines & completed repair of Lenguï gennaker (ca. 1100–2200). Konkordia launched c. 1700. Fannar & Hanna (rec from Anna Karen) went on Quest sail, joined club. ÁMJ, RLG, TEL on Quest. ES, Kelvin fishing. Wingfoilers (JP, Gylfi, Joana) had really great practice: J, G on foils, G > 10s.$dq$, $dq${"h1t": "05:00", "h1h": "3.5", "l1t": "11:06", "l1h": "1.0", "h2t": "17:06", "h2h": "3.5", "l2t": "23:24", "l2h": "0.6"}$dq$::jsonb, NULL, NULL, $dq$steve$dq$, '2026-06-28T19:46:15.925Z'::timestamptz, '2026-06-28T19:46:15.925Z'::timestamptz),
('87dcdf1f-01ff-5459-982d-9347f2ad08b2'::uuid, '2026-06-28'::date, $dq${}$dq$::jsonb, $dq${}$dq$::jsonb, $dq$[]$dq$::jsonb, $dq$[]$dq$::jsonb, $dq$No SDS.$dq$, $dq${"h1t": "05:42", "h1h": "3.6", "l1t": "11:48", "l1h": "0.9", "h2t": "17:48", "h2h": "3.6", "l2t": "", "l2h": ""}$dq$::jsonb, $dq$steve$dq$, '2026-06-28T19:46:44.773Z'::timestamptz, $dq$steve$dq$, '2026-06-28T19:46:48.068Z'::timestamptz, '2026-06-28T19:46:48.068Z'::timestamptz),
('af0f3b0a-2a4c-5733-a565-98453c4d0836'::uuid, '2026-06-29'::date, $dq${}$dq$::jsonb, $dq${}$dq$::jsonb, $dq$[]$dq$::jsonb, $dq$[{"bft": 3, "ws": 4, "wg": 7, "wd": 247, "dir": "WSW", "wv": 0.7, "waveDir": "WSW", "sst": 12, "tc": 10, "feels": 8, "pres": 997, "presTrend": "rising", "cond": {"icon": "🌧️", "desc": "Rain", "code": 61}, "flag": "green", "ts": "2026-06-30T11:21", "time": "09:00", "retro": true}, {"bft": 4, "ws": 6, "wg": 10, "wd": 260, "dir": "W", "wv": 0.9, "waveDir": "WSW", "sst": 12, "tc": 11, "feels": 7, "pres": 1000, "presTrend": "rising", "cond": {"icon": "☁️", "desc": "Overcast", "code": 3}, "flag": "green", "ts": "2026-06-30T11:22", "time": "13:00", "retro": true}, {"bft": 4, "ws": 6, "wg": 11, "wd": 245, "dir": "WSW", "wv": 0.9, "waveDir": "WSW", "sst": 12.1, "tc": 12, "feels": 7, "pres": 1002, "presTrend": "rising", "cond": {"icon": "☁️", "desc": "Overcast", "code": 3}, "flag": "green", "ts": "2026-06-30T11:22", "time": "17:00", "retro": true}]$dq$::jsonb, $dq$Atli covered NW pontoon. ÁMJ bailed on Brokey (was solo, already wet from afternoon). Bjarki H. came for æfingahópur. Had some time on wingfoil, but then was cold for opti training. Orion sailed solo rather than with Brokey(?) Þorgrimur tried rowing solo; not confident with control in waves. Long clean up.$dq$, $dq${"h1t": "06:24", "h1h": "3.7", "l1t": "00:06", "l1h": "0.5", "h2t": "18:24", "h2h": "3.7", "l2t": "12:24", "l2h": "0.8"}$dq$::jsonb, NULL, NULL, $dq$steve$dq$, '2026-06-30T11:36:45.731Z'::timestamptz, '2026-06-30T11:44:28.520Z'::timestamptz),
('e7777c28-2437-5c69-b467-f2fa9bae498f'::uuid, '2026-06-30'::date, $dq${}$dq$::jsonb, $dq${}$dq$::jsonb, $dq$[]$dq$::jsonb, $dq$[{"bft": 3, "ws": 5, "wg": 10, "wd": 188, "dir": "S", "wv": 0.9, "waveDir": "WSW", "sst": 11.9, "tc": 11, "feels": 7, "pres": 1011, "presTrend": "steady", "cond": {"icon": "☁️", "desc": "Overcast", "code": 3}, "flag": "green", "ts": "2026-07-01T13:46", "time": "09:00", "retro": true}, {"bft": 4, "ws": 7, "wg": 13, "wd": 176, "dir": "S", "wv": 1, "waveDir": "SW", "sst": 12, "tc": 12, "feels": 8, "pres": 1012, "presTrend": "steady", "cond": {"icon": "☁️", "desc": "Overcast", "code": 3}, "flag": "green", "ts": "2026-07-01T13:46", "time": "13:00", "retro": true}, {"bft": 4, "ws": 7, "wg": 13, "wd": 186, "dir": "S", "wv": 1.1, "waveDir": "SW", "sst": 12, "tc": 12, "feels": 8, "pres": 1011, "presTrend": "steady", "cond": {"icon": "☁️", "desc": "Overcast", "code": 3}, "flag": "green", "ts": "2026-07-01T13:46", "time": "17:00", "retro": true}]$dq$::jsonb, $dq$Overall good day given conditions. JP stayed on öryggisbátur in PM. Big help. Sigga + 2 on Yngling. Snorri, ÁMJ? on foil.$dq$, $dq${"h1t": "06:54", "h1h": "3.7", "l1t": "00:42", "l1h": "0.4", "h2t": "19:00", "h2h": "3.7", "l2t": "13:00", "l2h": "0.8"}$dq$::jsonb, NULL, NULL, $dq$steve$dq$, '2026-07-01T13:53:52.335Z'::timestamptz, '2026-07-01T13:58:01.484Z'::timestamptz),
('4c9f0252-f3a2-5c6d-b0d7-d26da2b1c545'::uuid, '2026-07-01'::date, $dq${}$dq$::jsonb, $dq${}$dq$::jsonb, $dq$[]$dq$::jsonb, $dq$[{"bft": 3, "ws": 4, "wg": 9, "wd": 207, "dir": "SSW", "wv": 1.3, "waveDir": "WSW", "sst": 11.9, "tc": 11, "feels": 8, "pres": 1008, "presTrend": "steady", "cond": {"icon": "☁️", "desc": "Overcast", "code": 3}, "flag": "green", "ts": "2026-07-01T22:40", "time": "09:00", "retro": true}, {"bft": 3, "ws": 5, "wg": 14, "wd": 198, "dir": "SSW", "wv": 1.4, "waveDir": "WSW", "sst": 11.9, "tc": 12, "feels": 8, "pres": 1006, "presTrend": "falling", "cond": {"icon": "☁️", "desc": "Overcast", "code": 3}, "flag": "green", "ts": "2026-07-01T22:40", "time": "13:00", "retro": true}, {"bft": 3, "ws": 5, "wg": 11, "wd": 202, "dir": "SSW", "wv": 1.4, "waveDir": "WSW", "sst": 12, "tc": 11, "feels": 7, "pres": 1004, "presTrend": "falling", "cond": {"icon": "☁️", "desc": "Overcast", "code": 3}, "flag": "green", "ts": "2026-07-01T22:40", "time": "17:00", "retro": true}]$dq$::jsonb, $dq$Things getting too loose during day sessions. Really nice evening session again. Good energy with foilers. Gunnur & Arna rowed.$dq$, $dq${"h1t": "07:30", "h1h": "3.8", "l1t": "01:12", "l1h": "0.4", "h2t": "19:30", "h2h": "3.8", "l2t": "13:30", "l2h": "0.7"}$dq$::jsonb, NULL, NULL, $dq$steve$dq$, '2026-07-01T22:40:38.960Z'::timestamptz, '2026-07-01T22:50:39.488Z'::timestamptz),
('1a71903a-5604-52ca-ade4-2831ce699ef5'::uuid, '2026-07-04'::date, $dq${}$dq$::jsonb, $dq${}$dq$::jsonb, $dq$[]$dq$::jsonb, $dq$[{"bft": 3, "ws": 4, "wg": 8, "wd": 319, "dir": "NW", "wv": 0.8, "waveDir": "WSW", "sst": 12, "tc": 10, "feels": 6, "pres": 1013, "presTrend": "rising", "cond": {"icon": "⛅️", "desc": "Partly cloudy", "code": 2}, "flag": "green", "ts": "2026-07-05T18:43", "time": "10:00", "retro": true}]$dq$::jsonb, $dq$Þorsteinn, Sindri setup spin on Carmen, sailed. Alli, Gunnar St. sailed 29er. Sigurborg sailed back to RVK, kl 17. Paddle Sindri +3 on kayaks. Bjarki H on Zest. (Broke tiller ext. joint.) Dalli+ came by. ÓBB. David, Sindri on Yngling. Olga, Þorgrimur, Leone rowing.$dq$, $dq${"h1t": "09:12", "h1h": "3.9", "l1t": "03:00", "l1h": "0.3", "h2t": "21:24", "h2h": "3.7", "l2t": "15:24", "l2h": "0.6"}$dq$::jsonb, NULL, NULL, $dq$steve$dq$, '2026-07-05T18:45:53.296Z'::timestamptz, '2026-07-05T18:45:53.296Z'::timestamptz),
('21df65d6-42c6-564e-a2f6-10eabfd507fe'::uuid, '2026-07-03'::date, $dq${}$dq$::jsonb, $dq${}$dq$::jsonb, $dq$[]$dq$::jsonb, $dq$[{"bft": 2, "ws": 2, "wg": 5, "wd": 242, "dir": "WSW", "wv": 0.8, "waveDir": "WSW", "sst": 11.7, "tc": 10, "feels": 7, "pres": 1005, "presTrend": "steady", "cond": {"icon": "⛅️", "desc": "Partly cloudy", "code": 2}, "flag": "green", "ts": "2026-07-05T18:46", "time": "09:00", "retro": true}, {"bft": 2, "ws": 3, "wg": 6, "wd": 290, "dir": "WNW", "wv": 0.8, "waveDir": "WSW", "sst": 11.9, "tc": 11, "feels": 9, "pres": 1005, "presTrend": "steady", "cond": {"icon": "☁️", "desc": "Overcast", "code": 3}, "flag": "green", "ts": "2026-07-05T18:46", "time": "13:00", "retro": true}, {"bft": 3, "ws": 5, "wg": 9, "wd": 313, "dir": "NW", "wv": 0.9, "waveDir": "WSW", "sst": 12.1, "tc": 11, "feels": 7, "pres": 1006, "presTrend": "steady", "cond": {"icon": "🌤", "desc": "Mainly clear", "code": 1}, "flag": "green", "ts": "2026-07-05T18:46", "time": "17:00", "retro": true}]$dq$::jsonb, $dq$Classes went smoothly. Evening: Sindri, Erla, Mike on Yngling. Others on 1+1 quest/zest mostly just working sail trim, tacks. Sigurborg came to harbor. Rowing in PM: Nora joined.$dq$, $dq${"h1t": "08:36", "h1h": "3.9", "l1t": "02:18", "l1h": "0.3", "h2t": "20:42", "h2h": "3.8", "l2t": "14:42", "l2h": "0.6"}$dq$::jsonb, NULL, NULL, $dq$steve$dq$, '2026-07-05T18:47:50.137Z'::timestamptz, '2026-07-05T18:53:01.078Z'::timestamptz);
