('3620366b-9783-5bf5-8d92-bf5fc2649fba'::uuid, '2026-07-02'::date, $dq${}$dq$::jsonb, $dq${}$dq$::jsonb, $dq$[]$dq$::jsonb, $dq$[{"bft": 4, "ws": 7, "wg": 16, "wd": 235, "dir": "SW", "wv": 2.3, "waveDir": "WSW", "sst": 11.8, "tc": 9, "feels": 4, "pres": 1002, "presTrend": "steady", "cond": {"icon": "⛅️", "desc": "Partly cloudy", "code": 2}, "flag": "green", "ts": "2026-07-05T18:48", "time": "09:00", "retro": true}, {"bft": 4, "ws": 8, "wg": 16, "wd": 233, "dir": "SW", "wv": 2.3, "waveDir": "WSW", "sst": 11.8, "tc": 10, "feels": 5, "pres": 1003, "presTrend": "steady", "cond": {"icon": "🌧️", "desc": "Rain", "code": 80}, "flag": "green", "ts": "2026-07-05T18:48", "time": "13:00", "retro": true}, {"bft": 4, "ws": 6, "wg": 12, "wd": 235, "dir": "SW", "wv": 1.9, "waveDir": "WSW", "sst": 11.8, "tc": 10, "feels": 6, "pres": 1001, "presTrend": "falling", "cond": {"icon": "☁️", "desc": "Overcast", "code": 3}, "flag": "green", "ts": "2026-07-05T18:48", "time": "17:00", "retro": true}]$dq$::jsonb, $dq$Velkomin námskeið visited AM/PM. Up to 46 on site. Caught south edge of squalls moving through in AM. Our kids at Nauth., cold, wanted home. Delayed them till ~kl 11 between squalls, shuttled back on motorboats. Had taken over on towed rowboats, inefficient launching. Afternoon was loose but smooth: people were exhausted after AM. SDS on sækisi w/ LAS. Evening: Sindri on Quest w/ ÞA, Corinna. Erla, Mike on Zests; Lárus, Þóra on Quest. Gróa launch party. Rowboat broke again in AM.$dq$, $dq${"h1t": "08:00", "h1h": "3.8", "l1t": "01:48", "l1h": "0.3", "h2t": "20:06", "h2h": "3.8", "l2t": "14:06", "l2h": "0.7"}$dq$::jsonb, NULL, NULL, $dq$steve$dq$, '2026-07-05T18:52:16.047Z'::timestamptz, '2026-07-05T18:58:01.607Z'::timestamptz),
('262e1c55-01ec-5e82-83d0-ec5fff11ea4d'::uuid, '2026-07-05'::date, $dq${}$dq$::jsonb, $dq${}$dq$::jsonb, $dq$[]$dq$::jsonb, $dq$[]$dq$::jsonb, $dq$No SDS.$dq$, $dq${"h1t": "09:54", "h1h": "3.8", "l1t": "03:42", "l1h": "0.4", "h2t": "22:12", "h2h": "3.7", "l2t": "16:06", "l2h": "0.6"}$dq$::jsonb, $dq$steve$dq$, '2026-07-05T20:06:00.640Z'::timestamptz, $dq$steve$dq$, '2026-07-05T20:06:03.253Z'::timestamptz, '2026-07-05T20:06:03.253Z'::timestamptz),
('f74ec43c-741f-5d97-87a9-ad780a4fcea5'::uuid, '2026-07-06'::date, $dq${}$dq$::jsonb, $dq${}$dq$::jsonb, $dq$[]$dq$::jsonb, $dq$[{"bft": 3, "ws": 4, "wg": 7, "wd": 96, "dir": "E", "wv": 0.3, "waveDir": "SW", "sst": 12.6, "tc": 11, "feels": 8, "pres": 1007, "presTrend": "falling", "cond": {"icon": "☁️", "desc": "Overcast", "code": 3}, "flag": "green", "ts": "2026-07-07T09:53", "time": "09:00", "retro": true}, {"bft": 2, "ws": 3, "wg": 6, "wd": 102, "dir": "ESE", "wv": 0.3, "waveDir": "S", "sst": 12.7, "tc": 13, "feels": 10, "pres": 1006, "presTrend": "steady", "cond": {"icon": "☁️", "desc": "Overcast", "code": 3}, "flag": "green", "ts": "2026-07-07T09:53", "time": "13:00", "retro": true}, {"bft": 2, "ws": 2, "wg": 5, "wd": 142, "dir": "SE", "wv": 0.2, "waveDir": "SW", "sst": 12.8, "tc": 14, "feels": 12, "pres": 1006, "presTrend": "steady", "cond": {"icon": "🌧️", "desc": "Rain", "code": 61}, "flag": "green", "ts": "2026-07-07T09:53", "time": "17:00", "retro": true}]$dq$::jsonb, $dq$Typical Monday intro; nothing extraordinary. In PM: Helgi + 1 Yngling, Kayak. Sverrir + 2 on red boat; Egill, ÁMJ on 29er (with Alli, Snorri). SV mad repairs to Europe. Melissa had repairs to Opti (adopted by RLG?). Need more hardware. Gylfi, Pétur came by for foiling. Stayed on land. LAS-OA: first sail on Yngling, then G2 on Topper; others 3x tacks on Zest. Framh-OA 2x quest. Light winds. Consider blending groups.$dq$, $dq${"h1t": "10:42", "h1h": "3.7", "l1t": "04:24", "l1h": "0.5", "h2t": "23:06", "h2h": "3.6", "l2t": "16:54", "l2h": "0.7"}$dq$::jsonb, NULL, NULL, $dq$steve$dq$, '2026-07-07T10:03:00.011Z'::timestamptz, '2026-07-07T10:03:00.011Z'::timestamptz),
('e97319d2-6bbd-56ea-8d0b-2dceeee48ee2'::uuid, '2026-07-07'::date, $dq${}$dq$::jsonb, $dq${}$dq$::jsonb, $dq$[]$dq$::jsonb, $dq$[{"bft": 3, "ws": 5, "wg": 8, "wd": 86, "dir": "E", "wv": 0.6, "waveDir": "ESE", "sst": 12.4, "tc": 10, "feels": 7, "pres": 1000, "presTrend": "falling", "cond": {"icon": "🌧️", "desc": "Rain", "code": 61}, "flag": "green", "ts": "2026-07-08T09:48", "time": "09:00", "retro": true}, {"bft": 3, "ws": 4, "wg": 7, "wd": 91, "dir": "E", "wv": 0.5, "waveDir": "ESE", "sst": 12.4, "tc": 12, "feels": 9, "pres": 999, "presTrend": "steady", "cond": {"icon": "🌧️", "desc": "Rain", "code": 61}, "flag": "green", "ts": "2026-07-08T09:48", "time": "13:00", "retro": true}, {"bft": 5, "ws": 9, "wg": 16, "wd": 140, "dir": "SE", "wv": 0.5, "waveDir": "SSE", "sst": 12.5, "tc": 13, "feels": 8, "pres": 999, "presTrend": "steady", "cond": {"icon": "☁️", "desc": "Overcast", "code": 3}, "flag": "green", "ts": "2026-07-08T09:48", "time": "17:00", "retro": true}]$dq$::jsonb, $dq$Rough weather day: very rainy, windy AM. Varúlfur & capture the flag. Smooth given the circumstances. PM windy: Framh. took 1 zest, reefed, switching out crews/tasks at each point. Ended up at Nauth., SDS towed boat back. LAS had land/harbor games led by Bjarki/Arnhildur: Skipstj. kemur > hiking bench > knots > beach/kayak relay with challenges. Strong day for creative solving. Wingfoilers came throughout day: 1330 Gylfi, Pétur; 1530 + Hjörtur, Jón; 1730 Helena, Joana. Canceled LAS/Framh - OA; Didn't send out Hæfur háseti crew. Snorri out with ÁMJ/ES on Quest, RLG on Opti. Quest dismasted when forestay pin came out. No injury, no other damage.$dq$, $dq${"h1t": "11:36", "h1h": "3.6", "l1t": "05:18", "l1h": "0.7", "h2t": "", "h2h": "", "l2t": "17:54", "l2h": "0.7"}$dq$::jsonb, NULL, NULL, $dq$steve$dq$, '2026-07-08T09:58:52.523Z'::timestamptz, '2026-07-08T09:58:52.523Z'::timestamptz),
('25f6ccf7-07e3-5f1b-868d-5e144298f27f'::uuid, '2026-07-08'::date, $dq${}$dq$::jsonb, $dq${}$dq$::jsonb, $dq$[]$dq$::jsonb, $dq$[{"bft": 3, "ws": 4, "wg": 6, "wd": 190, "dir": "S", "wv": 0.7, "waveDir": "SSW", "sst": 12.4, "tc": 11, "feels": 9, "pres": 1002, "presTrend": "steady", "cond": {"icon": "☁️", "desc": "Overcast", "code": 3}, "flag": "green", "ts": "2026-07-09T09:35", "time": "01:00", "retro": true}, {"bft": 2, "ws": 3, "wg": 6, "wd": 203, "dir": "SSW", "wv": 0.7, "waveDir": "SW", "sst": 12.3, "tc": 10, "feels": 8, "pres": 1002, "presTrend": "steady", "cond": {"icon": "☁️", "desc": "Overcast", "code": 3}, "flag": "green", "ts": "2026-07-09T09:36", "time": "05:00", "retro": true}, {"bft": 2, "ws": 3, "wg": 6, "wd": 188, "dir": "S", "wv": 0.7, "waveDir": "SW", "sst": 12.3, "tc": 11, "feels": 9, "pres": 1003, "presTrend": "steady", "cond": {"icon": "☁️", "desc": "Overcast", "code": 3}, "flag": "green", "ts": "2026-07-09T09:35", "time": "09:00", "retro": true}]$dq$::jsonb, $dq$LVS: kopoho; used SUP paddles in árabát, rigi; LAS: 2x quest; FHB: bessastaðir; LASOA - tack on reach on Quest; FHOA - 1Q2Z1T - low wind. Olga, Nora, Þorgrímur rowing.$dq$, $dq${"h1t": "00:06", "h1h": "3.5", "l1t": "06:18", "l1h": "0.8", "h2t": "12:36", "h2h": "3.5", "l2t": "19:00", "l2h": "0.7"}$dq$::jsonb, NULL, NULL, $dq$steve$dq$, '2026-07-09T09:39:23.908Z'::timestamptz, '2026-07-09T09:39:23.908Z'::timestamptz),
('ccd14b2d-b4b6-5510-8210-583d10affcd9'::uuid, '2026-07-09'::date, $dq${}$dq$::jsonb, $dq${}$dq$::jsonb, $dq$[]$dq$::jsonb, $dq$[{"bft": 3, "ws": 4, "wg": 9, "wd": 175, "dir": "S", "wv": 0.7, "waveDir": "SW", "sst": 12.2, "tc": 12, "feels": 9, "pres": 998, "presTrend": "steady", "cond": {"icon": "☁️", "desc": "Overcast", "code": 3}, "flag": "green", "ts": "2026-07-10T10:52", "time": "09:00", "retro": true}, {"bft": 3, "ws": 5, "wg": 9, "wd": 192, "dir": "SSW", "wv": 0.7, "waveDir": "SW", "sst": 12.2, "tc": 12, "feels": 9, "pres": 998, "presTrend": "steady", "cond": {"icon": "🌧️", "desc": "Rain", "code": 80}, "flag": "green", "ts": "2026-07-10T10:52", "time": "13:00", "retro": true}, {"bft": 3, "ws": 3, "wg": 8, "wd": 206, "dir": "SSW", "wv": 0.7, "waveDir": "SW", "sst": 12.3, "tc": 11, "feels": 9, "pres": 999, "presTrend": "steady", "cond": {"icon": "🌧️", "desc": "Rain", "code": 80}, "flag": "green", "ts": "2026-07-10T10:52", "time": "17:00", "retro": true}]$dq$::jsonb, $dq$LVS: Nauthólsvík; LAS: 2Q, ?Z, more independent sailing. Framh: Kopoho...met with military exercises (!) Some chaos, apparently strong wind at harbor. PM: Viktor with LAS; Sævarður & Bjarki scuttled (B not feeling well); Hermann/Éva on 2Z; Orri, Helgi Steinarr on Carmen; Anna Karen +2 (ÍSÍ) on Yngling. Sækisi out. Gummi/Gummi + Eva/Rebekka on Zest, Topper. Fajer on kayak; ÁMJ on radial. Þorgrímur & Melissa rowing. Stjórnafundur limited. Íris Björg með Turkish num-nums.$dq$, $dq${"h1t": "01:18", "h1h": "3.4", "l1t": "07:30", "l1h": "0.9", "h2t": "13:42", "h2h": "3.5", "l2t": "20:12", "l2h": "0.7"}$dq$::jsonb, NULL, NULL, $dq$steve$dq$, '2026-07-10T10:53:04.748Z'::timestamptz, '2026-07-10T10:53:04.748Z'::timestamptz),
('8fe28bb6-50fb-597d-9cf7-72cd3557b9ea'::uuid, '2026-07-10'::date, $dq${}$dq$::jsonb, $dq${}$dq$::jsonb, $dq$[]$dq$::jsonb, $dq$[{"bft": 3, "ws": 4, "wg": 9, "wd": 255, "dir": "WSW", "wv": 0.9, "waveDir": "WSW", "sst": 12.1, "tc": 10, "feels": 7, "pres": 1010, "presTrend": "rising", "cond": {"icon": "🌧️", "desc": "Rain", "code": 80}, "flag": "green", "ts": "2026-07-13T12:10", "time": "09:00", "retro": true}, {"bft": 3, "ws": 5, "wg": 10, "wd": 261, "dir": "W", "wv": 0.8, "waveDir": "WSW", "sst": 12.1, "tc": 12, "feels": 9, "pres": 1012, "presTrend": "rising", "cond": {"icon": "☁️", "desc": "Overcast", "code": 3}, "flag": "green", "ts": "2026-07-13T12:10", "time": "13:00", "retro": true}, {"bft": 3, "ws": 5, "wg": 9, "wd": 230, "dir": "SW", "wv": 0.7, "waveDir": "WSW", "sst": 12.2, "tc": 13, "feels": 9, "pres": 1015, "presTrend": "rising", "cond": {"icon": "☁️", "desc": "Overcast", "code": 3}, "flag": "green", "ts": "2026-07-13T12:10", "time": "17:00", "retro": true}]$dq$::jsonb, $dq$All nominal -- rocket popped from overinflation. Should be repairable. Evening class: Bjarki got cold, went to shore, otherwise just everyone practicing basic skills. (Some wind talk with Sævarður.) Gylfi, Hrefna capsized on harbor entry, G had to swim under sail. All good after.$dq$, $dq${"h1t": "02:30", "h1h": "3.5", "l1t": "08:42", "l1h": "0.9", "h2t": "14:54", "h2h": "3.6", "l2t": "21:18", "l2h": "0.5"}$dq$::jsonb, NULL, NULL, $dq$steve$dq$, '2026-07-13T12:17:57.531Z'::timestamptz, '2026-07-13T12:17:57.531Z'::timestamptz),
('336f955d-69ef-54ba-b3b8-03d541983ed4'::uuid, '2026-07-11'::date, $dq${}$dq$::jsonb, $dq${}$dq$::jsonb, $dq$[]$dq$::jsonb, $dq$[{"bft": 3, "ws": 5, "wg": 10, "wd": 185, "dir": "S", "wv": 0.9, "waveDir": "SW", "sst": 12.1, "tc": 12, "feels": 10, "pres": 1019, "presTrend": "steady", "cond": {"icon": "☁️", "desc": "Overcast", "code": 3}, "flag": "green", "ts": "2026-07-13T12:18", "time": "10:00", "retro": true}]$dq$::jsonb, $dq$Hermann, Éva on Yngling. ÁMJ, Alli, ES on 29er. Corinna on Zest. Viktor, Ýma on Quest. SDS, Helgi Steinarr on Yngling ca. 14–15. Snorri on wingfoil - recalled with talk about scheduling activities, etc. Getting loose with support boats. Talked with Corinna about setting up starts, etc, on club days as a way for her/others practice, both as sailors & keppnistjórn. Brokey was having 24h marathon on 2x quest. Gusty.$dq$, $dq${"h1t": "03:42", "h1h": "3.7", "l1t": "09:48", "l1h": "0.8", "h2t": "16:00", "h2h": "3.8", "l2t": "22:18", "l2h": "0.2"}$dq$::jsonb, NULL, NULL, $dq$steve$dq$, '2026-07-13T12:22:21.315Z'::timestamptz, '2026-07-13T12:22:21.315Z'::timestamptz),
