('d2af3b07-f048-5570-a887-7e4861db35a6'::uuid, '2026-07-23'::date, $dq${}$dq$::jsonb, $dq${}$dq$::jsonb, $dq$[]$dq$::jsonb, $dq$[{"bft": 4, "ws": 6, "wg": 10, "wd": 231, "dir": "SW", "wv": 1.6, "waveDir": "WSW", "sst": 11.7, "tc": 11, "feels": 8, "pres": 1007, "presTrend": "steady", "cond": {"icon": "☁️", "desc": "Overcast", "code": 3}, "flag": "green", "ts": "2026-07-23T10:27", "time": "09:00", "retro": true}, {"bft": 3, "ws": 5, "wg": 10, "wd": 207, "dir": "SSW", "wv": 1.6, "waveDir": "WSW", "sst": 11.9, "tc": 13, "feels": 10, "pres": 1003, "presTrend": "falling", "cond": {"icon": "☁️", "desc": "Overcast", "code": 3}, "flag": "green", "ts": "2026-07-27T12:19", "time": "17:00", "retro": true}]$dq$::jsonb, $dq$LVS: Kópóhö. Valur missing after warmup. Had been in bathroom, but must have left th e house not realizing everyone was down at dock (?!) Had tried to go by foot to kopoho, came back to house. SDS shuttled to group. Had contacted mother, Freyja, to see if he had gone home. Confirmed he was here after. (Had gone to library at hamraborg...?!) T390 lost its padeye for painter--no towing. Moved kids to prammi. Ca. 11:30 Elvar Ágúst complained of neck pain, left side: sensitive to touch, motion to left and back. Localized above shoulder. Wanted to head home: picked up by father ca. 11:40, took wetsuit 401 with him. Won't be here Friday (traveling). LAS: 2x Quest tacking on reach with buoys, independent. FH-B: Alftanes - big waves.. Aron reported touching horse fence; Knútur got a rock in the head from thrown seaweed (iced it). A student spoke to Henrik at the beginning of the session about self harm, part of a developing pattern. See incident report. Open house: Gummi, Eva, Rebekka on Topper; Gunnur, Íris on Vogun; Birkir on kayak; Anna Karen, Bjössi on Carmen; Orri, David, Jóhanna on Yngling; Hermann, Éva on Gróa; Gunnar H & Þrúður on 2x ILCA; Bjarki H on Zest; New neighbor +2 on kayaks at end. Joana & Kris on wingfoils.  -- Þrúður, Gummi each helping people on ramp: lateral model coming online...$dq$, $dq${"h1t": "01:18", "h1h": "3.0", "l1t": "07:24", "l1h": "1.4", "h2t": "13:42", "h2h": "3.1", "l2t": "20:12", "l2h": "1.1"}$dq$::jsonb, $dq$steve$dq$, '2026-07-23T10:31:00.513Z'::timestamptz, $dq$steve$dq$, '2026-07-23T10:27:35.681Z'::timestamptz, '2026-07-27T12:19:51.047Z'::timestamptz),
