('fb6af712-443d-515c-b2f4-e5e5ca2fea50'::uuid, '2026-08-01'::date, $dq${}$dq$::jsonb, $dq${}$dq$::jsonb, $dq$[]$dq$::jsonb, $dq$[{"bft": 3, "ws": 5, "wg": 9, "wd": 344, "dir": "NNW", "wv": 0.7, "waveDir": "WNW", "sst": 12.2, "tc": 12, "feels": 8, "pres": 1019, "presTrend": "steady", "cond": {"icon": "🌤", "desc": "Mainly clear", "code": 1}, "flag": "green", "ts": "2026-08-04T13:32", "time": "10:00", "retro": true}]$dq$::jsonb, $dq$Relaxed. Olga around to help/learn the routines. Alli on support boat. Sindri on Zest w/ jib. Orri on Zest. Sigtryggur, Tristan, (Eyrún) on Yngling. Jói, (Sigrún), Orri on Carmen. Kris, Joana foiling. No rowers. Steina Dögg +1 on kayaks. Arna + (Ívar) arrived late, SDS joined them on Quest till ~ kl. 15.$dq$, $dq${"h1t": "08:12", "h1h": "4.2", "l1t": "02:00", "l1h": "0.1", "h2t": "20:24", "h2h": "4.1", "l2t": "14:18", "l2h": "0.3"}$dq$::jsonb, NULL, NULL, $dq$steve$dq$, '2026-08-04T13:36:41.733Z'::timestamptz, '2026-08-04T13:36:41.733Z'::timestamptz),
