('f1a09a97-eb8a-5fc3-846e-6b67d984b60d'::uuid, '2026-09-14'::date, $dq${}$dq$::jsonb, $dq${}$dq$::jsonb, $dq$[]$dq$::jsonb, $dq$[{"bft": 3, "ws": 4, "wg": 7, "wd": 4, "dir": "N", "wv": 0.8, "waveDir": "WNW", "sst": 10.9, "tc": 13, "feels": 10, "pres": 1000, "presTrend": "rising", "cond": {"icon": "☁️", "desc": "Overcast", "code": 3}, "flag": "green", "ts": "2026-09-15T21:40", "time": "16:00", "retro": true}]$dq$::jsonb, $dq$Arna, Rebekka on optis with diamond course. 3x clockwise, 1x counter. then sailed reach buoys 3x. Had to ID line bias after. ÁMJ, ES task on 29er was as many spin deploys as possible. ... ...5. Krys +1 on wing, kayak.$dq$, $dq${"h1t": "08:18", "h1h": "4.3", "l1t": "02:12", "l1h": "0.0", "h2t": "20:42", "h2h": "4.1", "l2t": "14:30", "l2h": "0.0"}$dq$::jsonb, NULL, NULL, $dq$steve$dq$, '2026-09-15T21:42:34.816Z'::timestamptz, '2026-09-15T21:42:34.816Z'::timestamptz),
('8eeb6f25-a1fa-553b-8994-8d1fb1fb4c3c'::uuid, '2026-09-16'::date, $dq${}$dq$::jsonb, $dq${}$dq$::jsonb, $dq$[]$dq$::jsonb, $dq$[]$dq$::jsonb, $dq$Sif headsail came to Ýmir. SDS talked to Jón re: kópóhó & future. S/V Tortuga secured its spot there. No water activity at Naustavör.$dq$, $dq${"h1t": "09:24", "h1h": "3.7", "l1t": "03:18", "l1h": "0.7", "h2t": "21:54", "h2h": "3.5", "l2t": "15:42", "l2h": "0.6"}$dq$::jsonb, NULL, NULL, $dq$steve$dq$, '2026-09-17T16:19:31.678Z'::timestamptz, '2026-09-17T16:19:31.678Z'::timestamptz),
('67d5c90c-7c3a-5db9-8873-d652327edcf6'::uuid, '2026-09-17'::date, $dq${}$dq$::jsonb, $dq${}$dq$::jsonb, $dq$[]$dq$::jsonb, $dq$[{"bft": 4, "ws": 8, "wg": 12, "wd": 309, "dir": "NW", "wv": 2.2, "waveDir": "WNW", "sst": 10.9, "tc": 10, "feels": 5, "pres": 984, "presTrend": "rising", "cond": {"icon": "🌧️", "desc": "Rain", "code": 61}, "flag": "green", "ts": "2026-09-17T16:24", "time": "12:40", "retro": true}, {"bft": 4, "ws": 7, "wg": 13, "wd": 298, "dir": "WNW", "wv": 2.1, "waveDir": "W", "sst": 10.9, "tc": 9, "feels": 5, "pres": 986, "presTrend": "steady", "cond": {"icon": "☁️", "desc": "Overcast", "code": 3}, "flag": "green", "ts": "2026-09-17T20:10", "time": "17:00", "retro": true}]$dq$::jsonb, $dq$Sigurvon came to harbor overnight. See Suðurhlíðarskóli log for program details. Gylfi out foiling c. 16, Joana 1630. Open House: JP on prammi. Gylfi, Hjörtur, Joana, Geir, Tymur on wings. Helgi Steinarr, Hrannar, Guðbjörg, +1 on Carmen (no reef...); Éva, Hermann on Yngling. Helena on Zest, Gunnar St on Aero7, Alli on Aero9 (12.5kn!); Sigurvon went out with 6, came back before leaving bay. DDL with SDS on black boat.  ÁMJ +7 on Quest.$dq$, $dq${"h1t": "10:00", "h1h": "3.4", "l1t": "03:54", "l1h": "1.0", "h2t": "22:36", "h2h": "3.1", "l2t": "16:18", "l2h": "0.9"}$dq$::jsonb, $dq$steve$dq$, '2026-09-17T20:10:51.852Z'::timestamptz, $dq$steve$dq$, '2026-09-17T16:25:08.267Z'::timestamptz, '2026-09-17T20:10:54.556Z'::timestamptz);
