('01619dc9-76f6-583e-b2dc-d3607fe61a17'::uuid, '2026-05-13'::date, $dq${}$dq$::jsonb, $dq${}$dq$::jsonb, $dq$[]$dq$::jsonb, $dq$[{"bft": 2, "ws": 3, "wg": 6, "wd": 311, "dir": "NW", "wv": 0.7, "waveDir": "WSW", "sst": 6.6, "tc": 6, "feels": 3, "pres": 1015, "presTrend": "falling", "cond": {"icon": "☁️", "desc": "Overcast", "code": 3}, "flag": "green", "ts": "2026-05-13T19:48", "time": "18:00", "retro": true}]$dq$::jsonb, $dq$Tested spinlock vests. Happy with them. Remember to add gas checks to checklists, skills assessment. Úlfur brought Brokey RIB to harbor. Salka departed to RVK. Contacted Ýmir re: motor, no response. Secured Ýmir as base for national team. Set up committees, emails in prep for board meeting.$dq$, $dq${"h1t": "03:42", "h1h": "3.7", "l1t": "09:54", "l1h": "0.6", "h2t": "16:06", "h2h": "3.9", "l2t": "22:18", "l2h": "0.3"}$dq$::jsonb, $dq$steve$dq$, '2026-05-13T19:59:03.456Z'::timestamptz, $dq$steve$dq$, '2026-05-13T19:48:50.516Z'::timestamptz, '2026-05-13T20:00:30.169Z'::timestamptz),
('d2324609-5cd3-55f1-97ff-4efee1f26d20'::uuid, '2026-05-14'::date, $dq${}$dq$::jsonb, $dq${}$dq$::jsonb, $dq$[]$dq$::jsonb, $dq$[{"bft": 2, "ws": 3, "wg": 5, "wd": 172, "dir": "S", "wv": 0.6, "waveDir": "WSW", "sst": 6.8, "tc": 9, "feels": 6, "pres": 1014, "presTrend": "steady", "cond": {"icon": "☁️", "desc": "Overcast", "code": 3}, "flag": "green", "ts": "2026-05-15T09:37", "time": "18:00", "retro": true}]$dq$::jsonb, $dq$Alli, Gunnar H, Íris, Þrúður sailing in AM (11–12 ish); Heimir +1 on rowboat; work on Konkordía, Ásdís. Ásgeir, Rebekka, Gunnar St. in evening (Topper, Opti, Aero). Board meeting at kl. 19. SDS invited Gunnur Ýr to get a sense of club structure.$dq$, $dq${"h1t": "04:30", "h1h": "4.0", "l1t": "10:42", "l1h": "0.3", "h2t": "16:48", "h2h": "4.1", "l2t": "23:00", "l2h": "0.0"}$dq$::jsonb, NULL, NULL, $dq$steve$dq$, '2026-05-15T09:43:43.836Z'::timestamptz, '2026-05-15T10:04:42.342Z'::timestamptz),
('71c7ac86-dd2d-587e-9e9e-61e01da83542'::uuid, '2026-05-15'::date, $dq${}$dq$::jsonb, $dq${}$dq$::jsonb, $dq$[]$dq$::jsonb, $dq$[{"bft": 5, "ws": 9, "wg": 17, "wd": 127, "dir": "SE", "wv": 0.7, "waveDir": "S", "sst": 6.7, "tc": 9, "feels": 3, "pres": 1005, "presTrend": "falling", "cond": {"icon": "☁️", "desc": "Overcast", "code": 3}, "flag": "green", "ts": "2026-05-15T20:40", "time": "16:00", "retro": true}]$dq$::jsonb, $dq$Mads arrived to begin 2 week National Team training. Haukur, (Elías) launched from here. Mads in blue RIB. Ásgeir installed 2nd set of lifelines on Gróa. SDS reattached hatch cover. (Needs to be sanded, prettified.) Contacted Dofri again re: house needs. SDS contacted Hæfur háseti curious; Kristin Gúsa; JP spoke with GS re: Ýmir/Brokey collabs.$dq$, $dq${"h1t": "05:18", "h1h": "4.2", "l1t": "11:24", "l1h": "0.2", "h2t": "17:30", "h2h": "4.3", "l2t": "23:42", "l2h": "-0.2"}$dq$::jsonb, $dq$steve$dq$, '2026-05-15T20:47:15.239Z'::timestamptz, $dq$steve$dq$, '2026-05-15T20:41:15.411Z'::timestamptz, '2026-05-15T20:47:19.647Z'::timestamptz),
('70785f08-7f7a-5dbc-9dfe-0db706052986'::uuid, '2026-05-16'::date, $dq${}$dq$::jsonb, $dq${}$dq$::jsonb, $dq$[]$dq$::jsonb, $dq$[{"bft": 4, "ws": 7, "wg": 13, "wd": 115, "dir": "ESE", "wv": 1.1, "waveDir": "SW", "sst": 6.7, "tc": 7, "feels": 2, "pres": 999, "presTrend": "steady", "cond": {"icon": "🌧️", "desc": "Rain", "code": 61}, "flag": "green", "ts": "2026-05-16T15:28", "time": "10:00", "retro": true}]$dq$::jsonb, $dq$BIRK conditions at 10:00 were knots 12 (18) ASA. On water: Mads, Haukur, Keli; Gunnar H, Þrúður; Bjarki; Þorsteinn; Corinna; Daníel Guðj.; Rebekka (Opti). See rowing for additional detail.$dq$, $dq${"h1t": "06:00", "h1h": "4.4", "l1t": "12:06", "l1h": "0.1", "h2t": "18:12", "h2h": "4.4", "l2t": "", "l2h": ""}$dq$::jsonb, NULL, NULL, $dq$steve$dq$, '2026-05-16T15:28:55.301Z'::timestamptz, '2026-05-16T15:35:47.586Z'::timestamptz),
('e6cc5145-f1d5-52dc-8452-cc0dbf2e7fc3'::uuid, '2026-05-17'::date, $dq${}$dq$::jsonb, $dq${}$dq$::jsonb, $dq$[]$dq$::jsonb, $dq$[{"bft": 2, "ws": 2, "wg": 5, "wd": 100, "dir": "E", "wv": 1.1, "waveDir": "WSW", "sst": 6.7, "tc": 8, "feels": 5, "pres": 1007, "presTrend": "rising", "cond": {"icon": "☁️", "desc": "Overcast", "code": 3}, "flag": "green", "ts": "2026-05-17T17:44", "time": "10:30", "retro": true}, {"bft": 1, "ws": 1, "wg": 3, "wd": 107, "dir": "ESE", "wv": 1, "waveDir": "WSW", "sst": 6.7, "tc": 9, "feels": 6, "pres": 1007, "presTrend": "steady", "cond": {"icon": "🌧️", "desc": "Rain", "code": 61}, "flag": "green", "ts": "2026-05-17T17:44", "time": "12:20", "retro": true}]$dq$::jsonb, $dq$Mads continued with Haukur, Keli 3x(?) on the water. Mast raised on Gulla. Jib sheets, others were missing in house. See activity logs for others. Orri, Nökkvi, Ísak, Mads+ still at house when SDS left.$dq$, $dq${"h1t": "06:42", "h1h": "4.5", "l1t": "00:24", "l1h": "-0.3", "h2t": "18:54", "h2h": "4.4", "l2t": "12:48", "l2h": "0.0"}$dq$::jsonb, $dq$steve$dq$, '2026-05-17T17:54:25.218Z'::timestamptz, $dq$steve$dq$, '2026-05-17T17:44:53.083Z'::timestamptz, '2026-05-17T17:55:02.009Z'::timestamptz),
('b19424e7-35d1-5c55-981f-37b8a7c38048'::uuid, '2026-05-19'::date, $dq${}$dq$::jsonb, $dq${}$dq$::jsonb, $dq$[]$dq$::jsonb, $dq$[{"bft": 3, "ws": 4, "wg": 8, "wd": 294, "dir": "WNW", "wv": 0.5, "waveDir": "WNW", "sst": 7.6, "tc": 10, "feels": 7, "pres": 1007, "presTrend": "steady", "cond": {"icon": "⛅️", "desc": "Partly cloudy", "code": 2}, "flag": "green", "ts": "2026-05-20T10:33", "time": "18:00", "retro": true}]$dq$::jsonb, $dq$Sif sailed over to RVK (Sigga Maria, David, Íris Björg); Gulla sailed out/back to Naustavör (Orri, Corinna). Sif: slökkvitæki not renewed. Gulla: motor still needs last 8h of break in; review reefing system; where is spin?; pole fixes; needs power cable). AM was Mads/Haukur (Mads ran out of fuel in 5.4) Nökkvi continued work on K.$dq$, $dq${"h1t": "08:12", "h1h": "4.4", "l1t": "01:54", "l1h": "-0.3", "h2t": "20:24", "h2h": "4.2", "l2t": "14:18", "l2h": "0.2"}$dq$::jsonb, NULL, NULL, $dq$steve$dq$, '2026-05-20T10:35:15.037Z'::timestamptz, '2026-05-20T10:47:00.847Z'::timestamptz),
('b8180513-6c79-5854-be2f-41d2a87f2fc0'::uuid, '2026-05-18'::date, $dq${}$dq$::jsonb, $dq${}$dq$::jsonb, $dq$[]$dq$::jsonb, $dq$[{"bft": 3, "ws": 5, "wg": 9, "wd": 310, "dir": "NW", "wv": 0.4, "waveDir": "WSW", "sst": 7.1, "tc": 10, "feels": 7, "pres": 1010, "presTrend": "falling", "cond": {"icon": "☁️", "desc": "Overcast", "code": 3}, "flag": "green", "ts": "2026-05-20T10:47", "time": "15:00", "retro": true}, {"bft": 3, "ws": 4, "wg": 9, "wd": 297, "dir": "WNW", "wv": 0.4, "waveDir": "WSW", "sst": 7.1, "tc": 10, "feels": 6, "pres": 1009, "presTrend": "falling", "cond": {"icon": "⛅️", "desc": "Partly cloudy", "code": 2}, "flag": "green", "ts": "2026-05-20T10:47", "time": "17:00", "retro": true}]$dq$::jsonb, $dq$Visit from Vigdís & Velkomín (6 kids) 15:15–16:50. Kayaking, rowboat, paddleboard in harbor. Eager kids--Ásgeir helped with setup, running things. Talked about summer visit, setting up winter program. Valdi dropped off Mercury 6hp. First hour of break-in period. Mads/Haukur in AM.$dq$, $dq${"h1t": "07:24", "h1h": "4.5", "l1t": "01:12", "l1h": "-0.4", "h2t": "19:36", "h2h": "4.4", "l2t": "13:30", "l2h": "0.1"}$dq$::jsonb, NULL, NULL, $dq$steve$dq$, '2026-05-20T10:48:46.582Z'::timestamptz, '2026-05-20T11:33:50.311Z'::timestamptz),
('eef50bfe-092a-527d-90e7-28256d1ecffc'::uuid, '2026-05-21'::date, $dq${}$dq$::jsonb, $dq${}$dq$::jsonb, $dq$[]$dq$::jsonb, $dq$[{"bft": 2, "ws": 3, "wg": 7, "wd": 118, "dir": "ESE", "wv": 0.3, "waveDir": "WSW", "sst": 8, "tc": 15, "feels": 12, "pres": 1010, "presTrend": "steady", "cond": {"icon": "☁️", "desc": "Overcast", "code": 3}, "flag": "green", "ts": "2026-05-22T16:30", "time": "12:00", "retro": true}, {"bft": 3, "ws": 4, "wg": 6, "wd": 316, "dir": "NW", "wv": 0.2, "waveDir": "WSW", "sst": 8.2, "tc": 11, "feels": 8, "pres": 1010, "presTrend": "steady", "cond": {"icon": "🌧️", "desc": "Rain", "code": 61}, "flag": "green", "ts": "2026-05-22T16:37", "time": "18:00", "retro": true}]$dq$::jsonb, $dq$SDS had heated call with DÞ about hot water; followed up with email. Atli plumber came soon after to clean intake filter. Likely the full solution. Suðurhlíðarskóli was Adam, Jakob, Saga, JS, Rebekka, Veniz, Fajer: V, F, SDS in Quest; R in Opti; others paddling with JS (the day we meant to  have last session. R set up, sailed opti with no supervision; V/F each just had more practice tacking on a reach. No rowers in the evening: unstacked Zests, raised curtains in house. Ásgeir, Brynjar, Rebekka in Quest in PM: otherwise no open housers. Sigurborg came to dock c. 2100 for the week. Mads with Friða/Haukur midday, then session with Alli, GunnarSt, GunnarH, Þrúður in evening---really positive group energy after that.$dq$, $dq${"h1t": "09:54", "h1h": "3.9", "l1t": "03:36", "l1h": "0.1", "h2t": "22:12", "h2h": "3.8", "l2t": "16:06", "l2h": "0.6"}$dq$::jsonb, NULL, NULL, $dq$steve$dq$, '2026-05-22T16:30:50.562Z'::timestamptz, '2026-05-22T16:37:43.163Z'::timestamptz),
('c3469bff-f918-5d2d-b01a-3901a1303578'::uuid, '2026-05-22'::date, $dq${}$dq$::jsonb, $dq${}$dq$::jsonb, $dq$[]$dq$::jsonb, $dq$[{"bft": 2, "ws": 3, "wg": 6, "wd": 106, "dir": "ESE", "wv": 0.1, "waveDir": "SW", "sst": 8.2, "tc": 12, "feels": 9, "pres": 1007, "presTrend": "steady", "cond": {"icon": "🌧️", "desc": "Rain", "code": 61}, "flag": "green", "ts": "2026-05-22T20:58", "time": "18:00", "retro": true}]$dq$::jsonb, $dq$Mads, Keli, Haukur. SDSput together ILCA order. Changed gear oil i T9.8 - need trim tab/anode.$dq$, $dq${"h1t": "10:54", "h1h": "3.7", "l1t": "04:30", "l1h": "0.4", "h2t": "23:18", "h2h": "3.6", "l2t": "17:06", "l2h": "0.8"}$dq$::jsonb, $dq$steve$dq$, '2026-05-22T21:01:18.950Z'::timestamptz, $dq$steve$dq$, '2026-05-22T20:58:35.896Z'::timestamptz, '2026-05-22T21:01:22.327Z'::timestamptz),
('a437ea74-b1b9-5d47-9fea-3f647e710e9c'::uuid, '2026-05-23'::date, $dq${"590bf0c84df24945": true, "120d5d6a0f4d4a7e": true}$dq$::jsonb, $dq${"3c753ab1f13d46db": true, "fa2be00300264aa6": true, "cac93d951f4947ca": true, "b334ee634dc34629": true, "050c6d83e72d4465": true, "dc97f1fb65a24399": true, "42dd29fa887549e8": true, "6bb8c406634f4a31": true}$dq$::jsonb, $dq$[]$dq$::jsonb, $dq$[{"bft": 3, "ws": 5, "wg": 9, "wd": 94, "dir": "E", "wv": 0.2, "waveDir": "SSW", "sst": 8.2, "tc": 11, "feels": 8, "pres": 1003, "presTrend": "falling", "cond": {"icon": "☁️", "desc": "Overcast", "code": 3}, "flag": "green", "ts": "2026-05-23T22:14", "time": "10:00", "retro": true}]$dq$::jsonb, $dq$On the water: Carmen (Þorsteinn, Gylfi, Johannes); Zest (Tristan, Unnur); árabátur (Daniel, ?); Vogun (Gunnur, Olga); Laser (Íris); Yngling (Þrúður, GunnarH, +1); Alli; GunnarSt, Bjarni. DaníelG helped with Gróa, setting drying line; +Magnús looked at Ops App; SDS repaired, set up Rigiflex; Cleaned up line storage. Alli doing repairs ca. kl. 21; SDS left him to close.$dq$, $dq${"h1t": "12:00", "h1h": "3.6", "l1t": "05:36", "l1h": "0.6", "h2t": "", "h2h": "", "l2t": "18:18", "l2h": "0.9"}$dq$::jsonb, $dq$steve$dq$, '2026-05-23T22:20:24.443Z'::timestamptz, $dq$steve$dq$, '2026-05-23T22:14:51.282Z'::timestamptz, '2026-05-23T22:20:26.858Z'::timestamptz),
('b0c7f903-b59b-5fca-9fc2-0bca5ec61e1b'::uuid, '2026-05-24'::date, $dq${}$dq$::jsonb, $dq${}$dq$::jsonb, $dq$[]$dq$::jsonb, $dq$[{"bft": 4, "ws": 6, "wg": 10, "wd": 203, "dir": "SSW", "wv": 0.9, "waveDir": "SW", "sst": 8.1, "tc": 10, "feels": 5, "pres": 1007, "presTrend": "steady", "cond": {"icon": "🌧️", "desc": "Rain", "code": 80}, "flag": "green", "ts": "2026-05-24T21:36", "time": "12:00", "retro": true}]$dq$::jsonb, $dq$No scout sessions (hvítsunnudagur). Meistaraflokkur sailed. No SDS on site.$dq$, $dq${"h1t": "00:30", "h1h": "3.4", "l1t": "06:48", "l1h": "0.8", "h2t": "13:12", "h2h": "3.5", "l2t": "19:30", "l2h": "0.9"}$dq$::jsonb, $dq$steve$dq$, '2026-05-24T21:37:40.885Z'::timestamptz, $dq$steve$dq$, '2026-05-24T21:37:22.568Z'::timestamptz, '2026-05-24T21:37:43.640Z'::timestamptz),
('8aa076e6-b476-5f4f-a8a8-beff01eb432e'::uuid, '2026-05-25'::date, $dq${}$dq$::jsonb, $dq${}$dq$::jsonb, $dq$[]$dq$::jsonb, $dq$[{"bft": 3, "ws": 5, "wg": 9, "wd": 289, "dir": "WNW", "wv": 0.6, "waveDir": "SW", "sst": 8.5, "tc": 9, "feels": 6, "pres": 1011, "presTrend": "rising", "cond": {"icon": "☁️", "desc": "Overcast", "code": 3}, "flag": "green", "ts": "2026-05-26T10:48", "time": "17:00", "retro": true}]$dq$::jsonb, $dq$Mads, Haukur, Keli in AM; Alli et al. midday (3 boats?). SDS tried to get evinrude operational. Íris Björg substitute for Hannes. No Snorri. Replaced bungee on spin deployment Quest 1, rigged spin. Fixed oarlocks. Added some róður equipment to repair bags.$dq$, $dq${"h1t": "01:42", "h1h": "3.4", "l1t": "08:00", "l1h": "0.8", "h2t": "14:18", "h2h": "3.5", "l2t": "20:36", "l2h": "0.7"}$dq$::jsonb, NULL, NULL, $dq$steve$dq$, '2026-05-26T10:51:48.917Z'::timestamptz, '2026-05-28T15:53:10.316Z'::timestamptz),
('1d21915f-793c-5a36-83d4-376dc71307d8'::uuid, '2026-05-26'::date, $dq${}$dq$::jsonb, $dq${}$dq$::jsonb, $dq$[]$dq$::jsonb, $dq$[]$dq$::jsonb, $dq$Mads held a theory session, 2h, with Gunnar H, Gunnar St, Þrúður, Íris. Einar, Íris Björg og SDS met re: netbókhald. No rowers. Gunnar St had a prior water session with Mads earlier in the day. (Nat'l team presumably even earlier.)$dq$, $dq${"h1t": "02:54", "h1h": "3.5", "l1t": "09:06", "l1h": "0.8", "h2t": "15:18", "h2h": "3.6", "l2t": "21:36", "l2h": "0.6"}$dq$::jsonb, NULL, NULL, $dq$steve$dq$, '2026-05-28T15:36:35.460Z'::timestamptz, '2026-05-28T15:52:16.982Z'::timestamptz),
('f51cbde9-4bb5-5b34-b208-e31a65c3d933'::uuid, '2026-05-27'::date, $dq${}$dq$::jsonb, $dq${}$dq$::jsonb, $dq$[]$dq$::jsonb, $dq$[{"bft": 2, "ws": 3, "wg": 7, "wd": 240, "dir": "WSW", "wv": 1.3, "waveDir": "WSW", "sst": 8.6, "tc": 8, "feels": 5, "pres": 1020, "presTrend": "steady", "cond": {"icon": "🌧️", "desc": "Rain", "code": 61}, "flag": "green", "ts": "2026-05-28T15:49", "time": "19:00", "retro": true}]$dq$::jsonb, $dq$No rowers. SDS, Lara chat with Ísleifur. Then Mads held session with Alli, Úlfur (same as previous). Gunnar H & Þrúður on the water ca. 1930–2030. (Mads had AM sessions as well.) Atli and divers replaced 2 wings on dock (west) and added one (east).$dq$, $dq${"h1t": "03:48", "h1h": "3.6", "l1t": "10:00", "l1h": "0.7", "h2t": "16:06", "h2h": "3.7", "l2t": "22:24", "l2h": "0.4"}$dq$::jsonb, NULL, NULL, $dq$steve$dq$, '2026-05-28T15:49:31.557Z'::timestamptz, '2026-05-29T13:53:32.892Z'::timestamptz),
('9a73adb0-fc99-5424-9d49-8e4d57b0e3d4'::uuid, '2026-05-28'::date, $dq${}$dq$::jsonb, $dq${}$dq$::jsonb, $dq$[]$dq$::jsonb, $dq$[{"bft": 2, "ws": 2, "wg": 4, "wd": 41, "dir": "NE", "wv": 0.6, "waveDir": "WSW", "sst": 8.6, "tc": 9, "feels": 7, "pres": 1015, "presTrend": "falling", "cond": {"icon": "🌧️", "desc": "Rain", "code": 61}, "flag": "green", "ts": "2026-05-28T16:01", "time": "12:00", "retro": true}, {"bft": 2, "ws": 2, "wg": 4, "wd": 351, "dir": "N", "wv": 0.6, "waveDir": "W", "sst": 8.6, "tc": 10, "feels": 8, "pres": 1012, "presTrend": "falling", "cond": {"icon": "🌧️", "desc": "Rain", "code": 61}, "flag": "green", "ts": "2026-05-29T13:27", "time": "17:00", "retro": true}]$dq$::jsonb, $dq$Suðurhlíðarskóli at kl. 12. Landed at west cove of Maine Beach. Used SUP as bridge to prammi. (Remember there's much better slope here closer to the wreck than north edge.) - Water ~1.3m; No one showed until ~12:15 (JS, Veniz, RLG, Jakob). Decision to fish, jump at Kópóbryggja. After kl. 13 when we finally left. 20–30 min fishing by red mark. Kakó on water. Retrieved green Ístak buoy from near sker. Then RLG, V jumped from Kópóbryg. (Holding hands, RLG fell on V, no injury) Late back to school b/c of dry off.

Open house: Daníel G. continued work on Gróa; Pawel came to help [interest in Laser; get him in with meistarafl.] Tristan +1 in harbor; Bjarni on water; RLG, Alli around house; No rowers; Péter frá Þyt came to see Vogun, Lara. Sverrir + ? on kayaks. Stjórnafundur kl. 19:30.$dq$, $dq${"h1t": "04:42", "h1h": "3.7", "l1t": "10:42", "l1h": "0.7", "h2t": "16:54", "h2h": "3.8", "l2t": "23:06", "l2h": "0.3"}$dq$::jsonb, $dq$steve$dq$, '2026-05-28T16:08:45.598Z'::timestamptz, $dq$steve$dq$, '2026-05-28T16:02:07.236Z'::timestamptz, '2026-05-29T13:52:32.903Z'::timestamptz),
('a260d3bd-da08-5d73-96f7-023af2133baa'::uuid, '2026-05-29'::date, $dq${}$dq$::jsonb, $dq${}$dq$::jsonb, $dq$[]$dq$::jsonb, $dq$[{"bft": 3, "ws": 5, "wg": 9, "wd": 108, "dir": "ESE", "wv": 0.3, "waveDir": "N", "sst": 8.7, "tc": 7, "feels": 3, "pres": 1011, "presTrend": "rising", "cond": {"icon": "☁️", "desc": "Overcast", "code": 3}, "flag": "green", "ts": "2026-05-29T20:55", "time": "18:00", "retro": true}]$dq$::jsonb, $dq$Alli, Gunnar St moved Aeros to Hafnarfjörður; Gunnar H moved sail, mast to Hafn.$dq$, $dq${"h1t": "05:24", "h1h": "3.8", "l1t": "11:24", "l1h": "0.6", "h2t": "17:30", "h2h": "3.8", "l2t": "23:48", "l2h": "0.3"}$dq$::jsonb, $dq$steve$dq$, '2026-05-29T21:03:07.631Z'::timestamptz, $dq$steve$dq$, '2026-05-29T20:55:56.174Z'::timestamptz, '2026-05-29T21:03:10.855Z'::timestamptz),
('5ae45efe-8ba5-546e-ab16-9a48c5a0e2d0'::uuid, '2026-05-30'::date, $dq${"590bf0c84df24945": true, "120d5d6a0f4d4a7e": true}$dq$::jsonb, $dq${"3c753ab1f13d46db": true, "810899dec1184f54": true, "fa2be00300264aa6": true, "cac93d951f4947ca": true, "b334ee634dc34629": true, "dc97f1fb65a24399": true, "14ae3fd0e7d845f3": true, "42dd29fa887549e8": true, "6bb8c406634f4a31": true, "3e663ec3e5124ef4": true}$dq$::jsonb, $dq$[]$dq$::jsonb, $dq$[{"bft": 1, "ws": 1, "wg": 3, "wd": 18, "dir": "NNE", "wv": 0.3, "waveDir": "NW", "sst": 8.6, "tc": 8, "feels": 5, "pres": 1010, "presTrend": "steady", "cond": {"icon": "☁️", "desc": "Overcast", "code": 3}, "flag": "green", "ts": "2026-05-30T22:16", "time": "10:00", "retro": true}]$dq$::jsonb, $dq$Merkingar on Gróa. ÁMJ/SDS replaced base collar on Zest mast (wrong part sent from RS). Opnunarmót in Hafnarfjörður - Gunnar H, Gunnar S, Alli, Bjarni, Elias competed.$dq$, $dq${"h1t": "06:00", "h1h": "3.8", "l1t": "12:06", "l1h": "0.6", "h2t": "18:06", "h2h": "3.8", "l2t": "", "l2h": ""}$dq$::jsonb, $dq$steve$dq$, '2026-05-30T22:16:28.666Z'::timestamptz, $dq$steve$dq$, '2026-05-30T22:13:03.618Z'::timestamptz, '2026-05-30T22:17:15.281Z'::timestamptz),
('f81713d8-8e2b-5ad8-b4be-d5e883228e58'::uuid, '2026-05-31'::date, $dq${"590bf0c84df24945": true, "120d5d6a0f4d4a7e": true, "8faf9cca2e22456c": true, "b07f9da2db7b4087": true, "e50826a7ed624934": true, "7ad0226e3d0c4e8c": true, "181af1c6486d467a": true}$dq$::jsonb, $dq${"3c753ab1f13d46db": true, "810899dec1184f54": true, "cac93d951f4947ca": true, "050c6d83e72d4465": true, "b334ee634dc34629": true, "dc97f1fb65a24399": true, "14ae3fd0e7d845f3": true, "42dd29fa887549e8": true, "6bb8c406634f4a31": true}$dq$::jsonb, $dq$[]$dq$::jsonb, $dq$[{"bft": 3, "ws": 4, "wg": 7, "wd": 117, "dir": "ESE", "wv": 0.3, "waveDir": "SSW", "sst": 8.7, "tc": 13, "feels": 10, "pres": 1008, "presTrend": "steady", "cond": {"icon": "☁️", "desc": "Overcast", "code": 3}, "flag": "green", "ts": "2026-05-31T18:04", "time": "10:30", "retro": true}, {"bft": 3, "ws": 5, "wg": 8, "wd": 137, "dir": "SE", "wv": 0.3, "waveDir": "SSW", "sst": 8.8, "tc": 14, "feels": 11, "pres": 1009, "presTrend": "steady", "cond": {"icon": "☁️", "desc": "Overcast", "code": 3}, "flag": "green", "ts": "2026-05-31T18:04", "time": "12:20", "retro": true}]$dq$::jsonb, $dq$Last session with scouts. Lovely weather, especially in AM. No big finish, loose ending, but ultimately smooth. Konkordía, Ásdís/Gauja continued work. Magnús Vissu offered help around house this week. Egill, ÁMJ came by in evening. Took slökkvitæki for skoðun (5/6). Need to get fuel. Hannes and new Jói sailed Carmen in AM.$dq$, $dq${"h1t": "06:36", "h1h": "3.8", "l1t": "00:24", "l1h": "0.3", "h2t": "18:42", "h2h": "3.8", "l2t": "12:36", "l2h": "0.7"}$dq$::jsonb, $dq$steve$dq$, '2026-05-31T18:27:05.185Z'::timestamptz, $dq$steve$dq$, '2026-05-31T18:04:44.506Z'::timestamptz, '2026-05-31T18:27:44.323Z'::timestamptz),
('78116aca-90c0-5a15-81ab-28269f24b411'::uuid, '2026-06-01'::date, $dq${}$dq$::jsonb, $dq${}$dq$::jsonb, $dq$[]$dq$::jsonb, $dq$[{"bft": 2, "ws": 3, "wg": 6, "wd": 295, "dir": "WNW", "wv": 0.3, "waveDir": "SW", "sst": 9.5, "tc": 13, "feels": 11, "pres": 1005, "presTrend": "falling", "cond": {"icon": "☁️", "desc": "Overcast", "code": 3}, "flag": "green", "ts": "2026-06-01T21:58", "time": "17:00", "retro": true}]$dq$::jsonb, $dq$SDS took slökkvitæki for skoðun, got 2 more. Gave 1 to Kata to take to Sif. Got suzuki parts, incl. propeller. 15 pitch...should probably be 14 (existing one). Then powerwashed ramp. Should switch to bleach. First foiling jafningafræðsla session, 6ppl. Rowing: Lara learning rigiflex. SDS serviced 4hp suzuki, but no sustained running. Consider: 1st monday in June and there are 5 different club activities happening. :-)$dq$, $dq${"h1t": "07:12", "h1h": "3.8", "l1t": "00:54", "l1h": "0.3", "h2t": "19:12", "h2h": "3.7", "l2t": "13:12", "l2h": "0.7"}$dq$::jsonb, NULL, NULL, $dq$steve$dq$, '2026-06-01T21:59:05.661Z'::timestamptz, '2026-06-01T22:09:36.348Z'::timestamptz),
('f25faabf-73eb-5d8f-9573-509cf6fb3a82'::uuid, '2026-06-02'::date, $dq${}$dq$::jsonb, $dq${}$dq$::jsonb, $dq$[]$dq$::jsonb, $dq$[{"bft": 1, "ws": 0, "wg": 2, "wd": 270, "dir": "W", "wv": 0.3, "waveDir": "WSW", "sst": 9.3, "tc": 12, "feels": 11, "pres": 1002, "presTrend": "steady", "cond": {"icon": "☁️", "desc": "Overcast", "code": 3}, "flag": "green", "ts": "2026-06-02T23:26", "time": "09:00", "retro": true}, {"bft": 2, "ws": 2, "wg": 6, "wd": 309, "dir": "NW", "wv": 0.3, "waveDir": "WSW", "sst": 9.4, "tc": 13, "feels": 12, "pres": 1001, "presTrend": "steady", "cond": {"icon": "☁️", "desc": "Overcast", "code": 3}, "flag": "green", "ts": "2026-06-02T23:26", "time": "12:00", "retro": true}, {"bft": 2, "ws": 2, "wg": 5, "wd": 341, "dir": "NNW", "wv": 0.3, "waveDir": "SW", "sst": 9.5, "tc": 12, "feels": 10, "pres": 999, "presTrend": "falling", "cond": {"icon": "☁️", "desc": "Overcast", "code": 3}, "flag": "green", "ts": "2026-06-02T23:26", "time": "18:00", "retro": true}]$dq$::jsonb, $dq$Suðurhlíðarskóli all day. Older group kl. 9–12; younger after. up to 24 in younger group. kayaks, SUP, árabátar. Easy day, but: for 2027 - more wetsuits for adults; remind that there are no wetshoes (2x scraped feet); need instructors to have better fleet control or have +1 ýmir. Alli, Bjarni sailed in PM. Put Mercury 4hp (Gróu) on Carmen. Suzuki 4hp carb needs cleaning, new gaskets. Decided on 13 pitch for Suzuki.$dq$, $dq${"h1t": "07:42", "h1h": "3.7", "l1t": "01:30", "l1h": "0.4", "h2t": "19:48", "h2h": "3.7", "l2t": "13:48", "l2h": "0.8"}$dq$::jsonb, $dq$steve$dq$, '2026-06-02T23:30:25.535Z'::timestamptz, $dq$steve$dq$, '2026-06-02T23:26:48.358Z'::timestamptz, '2026-06-02T23:30:29.531Z'::timestamptz),
('c29ca6af-3685-58ec-8606-53bf01bce0a1'::uuid, '2026-06-03'::date, $dq${}$dq$::jsonb, $dq${}$dq$::jsonb, $dq$[]$dq$::jsonb, $dq$[]$dq$::jsonb, $dq$No archive data for weather at kl. 1700 (Was likely force 2, NNW ish). Magnús G. came to help in afternoon: cut up & disposed of rowing shells, fiberglass projects. Decided to keep extra Opti spars. We have 8 masts, 8 booms (+7) and then 10 spars. SDS got Suzuki 4hp working (cleaned carburetor. NB: if issues persist, check blockages - shredded the brass main jet t/f likely that particles may persist & block passages. 5–6 with blævængir. Alli & Bjarni on Aeros.$dq$, $dq${"h1t": "08:18", "h1h": "3.7", "l1t": "02:00", "l1h": "0.4", "h2t": "20:24", "h2h": "3.6", "l2t": "14:24", "l2h": "0.9"}$dq$::jsonb, NULL, NULL, $dq$steve$dq$, '2026-06-04T13:14:51.663Z'::timestamptz, '2026-06-04T13:15:08.843Z'::timestamptz),
